{"schema_version": 1, "unit_id": "tag:0G44:statement", "parent_tag": "0G43", "chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "risk_level": "R3", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a ring map. Denote <MATH_0002> the corresponding\nmorphism of affine schemes. Let <MATH_0003> and <MATH_0004>\nbe <MATH_0005>-modules. If <MATH_0006> is quasi-coherent then\nthe map\n<MATH_0007>\nsending a differential operator to its action on global sections\nis bijective.\n", "source_status": "CURRENT", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$R \\to A$", "MATH_0002": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{G}$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$$\n\\text{Diff}^k_{X/S}(\\mathcal{F}, \\mathcal{G}) \\to\n\\text{Diff}^k_{A/R}(\\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{F}), \\Gamma(X, \\mathcal{G}))\n$$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-affine-case-differential-operators}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "source_text_hash": "sha256:de5cdedfd6c1fc3f8ce0ae028d541e321e08f50158ed7c94318ee502bc0d38d3", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:82e49bcd2a987132326b5a518a276b3cbac239d2856752eb2389d880e138eb73", "source_math_hash": "sha256:2f54ed231ea70d2d45983ef1c3653f7ba140feba06a313a41a6c1b1fc533ff7f"}
